    abstract = {The safety inspection of natural gas pipelines faces challenges such as low efficiency, numerous blind spots, and high risks. This project proposes a UAV inspection system integrating multimodal perception and edge intelligence, which realizes intelligent operation and maintenance through hardware integration optimization, AI algorithm innovation, and digital twin closed-loop. Equipped with visible light, thermal imaging, and gas sensors, the system adopts the improved YOLOv8-CBAM-SE model to enhance the small target detection accuracy to 92.3\%. Combined with edge computing, the early warning delay is significantly reduced. In the 30-kilometer pipeline network pilot in Jiaxing, Zhejiang, the efficiency is significantly improved, with a hidden danger recognition rate of 95.8\%. The research verifies the technical feasibility and provides a paradigm for the digital transformation of the industry.},
